WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.539
(upbeat music)

00:00:02.539 --> 00:00:04.081
- [Voiceover] So Richard Wiseman of the

00:00:04.081 --> 00:00:06.322
University of Hertfordshire
set up a website

00:00:06.322 --> 00:00:08.459
called Laugh Lab to try
to find the funniest joke

00:00:08.459 --> 00:00:09.421
in the world.

00:00:09.421 --> 00:00:12.673
After about 40,000 submissions
rated by 1.5 million

00:00:12.673 --> 00:00:15.255
people, he finally found
the world's funniest joke.

00:00:16.501 --> 00:00:20.021
Two hunters are out int he woods
when one of them collapses.

00:00:20.021 --> 00:00:22.540
He doesn't seem to be breathing
and his eyes are glazed.

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:24.258
The other guy whips
out his phone and calls

00:00:24.258 --> 00:00:25.419
emergency service.

00:00:25.419 --> 00:00:26.742
He gasps as he says, "My friend is dead!

00:00:26.742 --> 00:00:28.739
"He's dead! What can I do?"

00:00:28.739 --> 00:00:30.341
The operator says, "Hey, calm down.

00:00:30.341 --> 00:00:31.456
"I can help.

00:00:31.456 --> 00:00:34.056
"First, let's just make
sure he's actually dead."

00:00:34.056 --> 00:00:36.238
Then there's a silence and all of a sudden

00:00:36.238 --> 00:00:37.980
a gunshot's heard.

00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:39.037
And then the guy gets back on the phone.

00:00:39.037 --> 00:00:40.874
He says, "Okay, what now?"

00:00:48.793 --> 00:00:50.709
Nothing?
- [Woman] No.

00:00:50.709 --> 00:00:52.194
- Come on, you know that's good.

00:00:52.194 --> 00:00:54.075
You know it's good, there's a smile.

00:00:54.075 --> 00:00:57.872
Oh, oh. Almost.

00:00:57.872 --> 00:01:00.543
(sad music)

00:01:00.543 --> 00:01:02.147
Did you not hear the joke?

00:01:02.147 --> 00:01:03.214
- I heard it.

00:01:03.214 --> 00:01:04.527
- [Host] I'm gonna read it one more time,

00:01:04.527 --> 00:01:06.988
'cause I just don't think you guys get

00:01:06.988 --> 00:01:10.947
really good humor, 'cause
this is like really good joke.

00:01:10.947 --> 00:01:11.793
It's proven.

00:01:11.793 --> 00:01:13.036
